<title>PHILIPPINES: PNB stockholders agree on capital hike.</title>
<headline>PNB stockholders agree on capital hike.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-12-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shareholders of Philippine National Bank approved on Tuesday an increase in the bank's capitalization to 25 billion pesos from 10 billion pesos.</p>
<p>The shareholders also agreed on a 37.5 percent stock dividend at their annual general meeting.  </p>
<p>No record date has been set for the dividend declaration which is yet to be approved by the Central Bank.</p>
<p>-- Manila newsroom 63 2 8418938 Fax 8176267</p>
</text>
